values
  ($t$1413$t$, $t$Harding Township$t$, $t$MORRIS$t$, $t$smoke_fire_cert$t$, $t$explicit_required$t$, $t$Smoke / CO alarm certificate$t$, $j$["Issued by: NJ Department of Community Affairs, Division of Fire Safety (state-enforced; Harding Township does not do this inspection) (NJ DCA, state)","Contact: Louis Kilmer, Fire Official of record for Harding (NJ Division of Fire Safety), per the state directory · (609) 633-6132","Apply: State fee tiers count business days between DCA's receipt and the closing date: more than ten business days for the lowest fee. Certificate must be used within 6 months (per the DCA form).","How to apply: Apply to the NJ Division of Fire Safety (the Township's Construction page links to the DCA Fire Safety online portal, firesolutions.dca.nj.gov). Mail address on the DCA form: PO Box 809, Trenton, NJ 08625-0809; checks payable to Treasurer, State of New Jersey. Phone (609) 633-6132.","Fire official in the NJ state directory (NJ DCA, state), updated 2/14/2025: Louis Kilmer · (609)633-6132","Smoke detector on each level including basements (not attic or crawl space), and outside each separate sleeping area within 10 feet of bedrooms","Carbon monoxide alarm outside each separate sleeping area","All alarms in working order; AC powered or interconnected alarms in homes built after January 1977 must be kept working","Fire extinguisher (still on the older DCA form; dropped from the state requirement in February 2025 by P.L.2025, c.19)","State rule: a 2025 law (P.L.2025, c.19) dropped the fire extinguisher from the state requirement. Follow the town's current form, which may still list one."]$j$::jsonb, $j$[{"label":"State smoke/CO certificate, applied more than 10 business days before closing","amount":"$45"},{"label":"State smoke/CO certificate, applied 4 to 10 business days before closing","amount":"$90"},{"label":"State smoke/CO certificate, closing less than 4 business days away","amount":"$161"}]$j$::jsonb, $t$https://firesolutions.dca.nj.gov/